# Firefly Keeper (Glasspond)
Firefly Keeper: * Ah. A new voice by the water.
Firefly Keeper: * I keep the lights over Glasspond. They have always been mine to keep.
Firefly Keeper: * The glen has a name. It says yours back before you say it. That is how it greets.
Firefly Keeper: * It already knew you were coming. It has been waiting, humming low.
